{"id":"wb-4-211","name":"梁启超故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"梁启超故居","text":"梁启超故居位于中国广东省江门市新会区会城街道南郊的茶坑村，是梁启超出生、成长的地方，1989年被列为广东省文物保护单位，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n整个建筑群建于清光绪年间，建筑面积412平方米，由故居、怡堂书室、回廊组成，砖木结构，是富有当地特色的民居建筑。\n有一处是村口的“奎楼”，俗称“文昌阁”，后来成为“宏文社学”的所在地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A2%81%E5%90%AF%E8%B6%85%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":93736652,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93736652","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1f14dedc7c9213f81dad6590.jpg","title":"Jiangmen003.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiangmen003.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/Jiangmen003.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"(Long night without wind) 长夜无风","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​位于江门市新会区的梁启超故居","width":320,"height":240}}